    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing... i don't want to \"evolve\" into something mediocre. i don't want an \"evolving journey\" if the destination is just being a washed up person who used to be good. isn't there a certain dignity in just leaving it alone? like, just walking away before the decay is complete so the memory of what i did actually stays pure?",
